flowchart TB
    developer[Developer] --> pr[Pull request]
    pr --> same_repo{Same-repository PR?}
    same_repo -->|No| fork_validation[Tests, linting, security scans,<br/>and Terraform init -backend=false]
    same_repo -->|Yes| checks_start[Required PR checks]

    subgraph pull_request_checks[Pull-request checks]
        frontend_ci[Frontend tests and linting]
        backend_ci[Backend tests and linting]
        snyk[Snyk dependency scan]
        sonar[SonarQube quality and security analysis]
        trivy[Trivy repository, secret, IaC, and image scans]
        terraform_checks[Terraform format, validate, TFLint, and plan]
    end

    checks_start --> frontend_ci
    checks_start --> backend_ci
    checks_start --> snyk
    checks_start --> sonar
    checks_start --> trivy
    checks_start --> terraform_checks
    frontend_ci --> merge[Protected merge to main]
    backend_ci --> merge
    snyk --> merge
    sonar --> merge
    trivy --> merge
    terraform_checks --> merge

    merge --> change{Changed scope}
    change -->|Frontend or backend| build[Build and scan changed image]
    build --> ecr[Push immutable digest to private ECR]
    ecr --> sandbox[GitHub environment: sandbox<br/>OIDC and configuration boundary]
    sandbox --> action[Deploy selected ECS service]
    action --> verification[ECS stability and smoke test]
    verification --> result{Successful?}
    result -->|Yes| complete[Deployment complete]
    result -->|No| rollback[Roll back affected ECS service<br/>to prior task definition and image digest]

    manual_apply[Workflow dispatch:<br/>select immutable main commit] --> fresh_plan[Create fresh plan for selected commit]
    fresh_plan --> terraform_sandbox[GitHub environment: sandbox]
    terraform_sandbox --> apply[Apply that exact plan]
